// and it scores the encoder's ABSOLUTE semantic quality, not just its fidelity to one teacher.
//
// gold, on the usual STS 0-4 scale:
//   4 = same meaning (paraphrase)          2 = same topic, different claim
//   3 = closely related, different focus   1 = same broad domain only        0 = unrelated
//
// Fields: lang ("it"|"en"), a, b, gold.
